{"id":"22d691584e16293f","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-geology-button-statement.md","title":"ZFC Geology Button Statement","display":"df-zfc-geology-button-statement — ZFC Geology Button Statement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-geology-button-statement","aliases":["58-df-zfc-geology-button-statement"],"display":"df-zfc-geology-button-statement — ZFC Geology Button Statement","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-geology-button-statement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-geology-button-statement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-geology-button-statement — ZFC Geology Button Statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper.md\">58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1de28866aa4ef668\" href=\"?note=1de28866aa4ef668\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\varphi\\in V\">\\(M,\\varphi\\in V\\)</span> (a transitive ZFC model and a sentence code in the language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\)</span> (canonical membership-structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper.md\">58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\)</span> (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (set-forcing extension predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1de28866aa4ef668\" href=\"?note=1de28866aa4ef668\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyButtonStatement}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyButtonStatement}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}button\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyButtonStatement}_S(M,\\varphi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists W,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathfrak W\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(W,M,\\mathbb P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak W,W)\n\\land\\mathfrak W\\models\\varphi\n\\land\n\\forall U,\\mathbb Q,H\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(U,W,\\mathbb Q,H)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak U\\;(\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak U,U)\n\\land\\mathfrak U\\models\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}button\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyButtonStatement}_S(M,\\varphi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists W,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathfrak W\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(W,M,\\mathbb P,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak W,W)\n\\land\\mathfrak W\\models\\varphi\n\\land\n\\forall U,\\mathbb Q,H\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(U,W,\\mathbb Q,H)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak U\\;(\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak U,U)\n\\land\\mathfrak U\\models\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The existential extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> realizes the possibility modality, and the universal quantification over all further set-forcing extensions of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> realizes necessity.</li>\n<li>Truth is evaluated in explicit membership structures, never on a bare carrier set; every world quantified by the modal clause is required to be a transitive ZFC model.</li>\n<li>Thus the assertion expands the modal abbreviation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\\Box\\varphi\">\\(\\Diamond\\Box\\varphi\\)</span> without treating <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\">\\(\\Diamond\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> as unexplained object-language operators.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"1de28866aa4ef668","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}$ (free-variable operator, see [[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)$ (canonical membership-structure predicate, see [[58-df-proper.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)$ (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"1de28866aa4ef668","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (set-forcing extension predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-geology-set-forcing-extension.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\varphi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyButtonStatement}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}button\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyButtonStatement}_S(M,\\varphi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists W,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathfrak W\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(W,M,\\mathbb P,G)\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak W,W)\n\\land\\mathfrak W\\models\\varphi\n\\land\n\\forall U,\\mathbb Q,H\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologySetForcingExtension}_S(U,W,\\mathbb Q,H)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak U\\;(\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak U,U)\n\\land\\mathfrak U\\models\\varphi)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{